  "RawMarkdown": "# Alex Example\n**Target role: Head of Applied AI Engineering**\n\n\n## Summary {#summary}\nCurated offline evaluation cases from failed tool calls, though the production effect remains unknown. Built a C# support-agent runtime using Azure OpenAI and Qdrant retrieval for internal operations.\n\n## Experience {#experience}\n\n### Applied AI Engineer - Example Operations {#experience-dc380d07b04a41829fdb6cdabfd08a72}\n*Jan 2025 - Present*\n\n- Curated offline evaluation cases from failed tool calls, though the production effect remains unknown.\n\n- Built a C# support-agent runtime using Azure OpenAI and Qdrant retrieval for internal operations.\n\n- Added per-tool authorization and idempotency keys before allowing the internal agent to update ticket state.\n\n### Senior Software Engineer - Example Commerce {#experience-c2b1292d1ab8410e9de34b9bd37e4f14}\n*Jan 2018 - Dec 2024*\n\n- Built C# billing retry queues and audit trails to enable the operations team to inspect failed attempts.\n\n- Led the API team and reviewed PostgreSQL recovery designs before the production release.\n\n## Additional Experience {#additional-experience}\n- **Research Developer**, Example Lab (Jan 2015 - Dec 2017)\n\n## Skills {#skills}\n**Role tools:** C#, Azure OpenAI, Qdrant\n\n",
  "RawJson": null,
  "PlainText": "# Alex Example\n**Target role: Head of Applied AI Engineering**\n\n\n## Summary {#summary}\nCurated offline evaluation cases from failed tool calls, though the production effect remains unknown. Built a C# support-agent runtime using Azure OpenAI and Qdrant retrieval for internal operations.\n\n## Experience {#experience}\n\n### Applied AI Engineer - Example Operations {#experience-dc380d07b04a41829fdb6cdabfd08a72}\n*Jan 2025 - Present*\n\n- Curated offline evaluation cases from failed tool calls, though the production effect remains unknown.\n\n- Built a C# support-agent runtime using Azure OpenAI and Qdrant retrieval for internal operations.\n\n- Added per-tool authorization and idempotency keys before allowing the internal agent to update ticket state.\n\n### Senior Software Engineer - Example Commerce {#experience-c2b1292d1ab8410e9de34b9bd37e4f14}\n*Jan 2018 - Dec 2024*\n\n- Built C# billing retry queues and audit trails to enable the operations team to inspect failed attempts.\n\n- Led the API team and reviewed PostgreSQL recovery designs before the production release.\n\n## Additional Experience {#additional-experience}\n- **Research Developer**, Example Lab (Jan 2015 - Dec 2017)\n\n## Skills {#skills}\n**Role tools:** C#, Azure OpenAI, Qdrant\n\n",
